{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Many calculators have a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Reciprocal\" title=\"Reciprocal\">reciprocal</a> key <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d377409325dafbbe11398c9d592f20247c2a0d17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{1}{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"26\" height=\"48\" /> that replaces the current number displayed with its reciprocal.  For example, if the display is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2f9a5bc1022baf54ffdd6c5a13138c4befd5d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{00004}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"59\" height=\"25\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d377409325dafbbe11398c9d592f20247c2a0d17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{1}{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"26\" height=\"48\" /> key is depressed, then the display becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6a807237397e9e581631aa0af69f6e9ed1c3755.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{000.25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684ede6849e649b1d54fd69dbcd0b52a9784847c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{00032}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"23\" /> is currently displayed, what is the fewest number of times you must depress the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d377409325dafbbe11398c9d592f20247c2a0d17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{1}{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"26\" height=\"48\" /> key so the display again reads <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684ede6849e649b1d54fd69dbcd0b52a9784847c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{00032}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"23\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca585cb0a10d1b1516363ba9bbb1b7681a8a00ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After pressing the reciprocal key once, the calculator will display the decimal representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f99038cfb4c72100160971a30c90eaf4fd831001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> (which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/7141dae4a59a9ee63a737a9042981acaa5b63fa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.03125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />).  After pressing the reciprocal key again, the calculator will display <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b2a33e76e33c4a219be30d4e97ec838060a3c38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\div \\frac{1}{32} = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />.  \n</p><p>So, after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a431f8e7b0ff6fd392b75cce5c065035b6833bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"30\" /> presses the calculator will display <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> again.  (Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/1/7112b9aa153e36219ae0f5a329d1c540a09e469e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{32} = 0.03125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" /> is a terminating decimal, there will not be any rounding.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57e2a4804afb1ffa5ecc283528105ad627cbc243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"72\" height=\"37\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/6/ff64fb011a9bfe41b0e410e166a90d7bc4bfb2a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x)) = 1 \\div \\frac{1}{x} = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"167\" height=\"38\" />.  Therefore, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff20cd46d80b7a9cbe327e7f2dac2bd29e82fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"38\" /> (that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f4c830dd3626d5c8c2ce578669969a2cb6b3824.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq \\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" />), a calculator displaying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> will first display <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> again after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a431f8e7b0ff6fd392b75cce5c065035b6833bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"30\" /> presses.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME\" title=\"1989 AJHSME\">1989 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•<